initializer refused under the outcome convention; a def-without-definition upstream bug exposed as its own fixture). Coverage honesty: 155 bindings / 175 function-arity entries, only 2 arities proven (subst 2+3); the inherited manifest has no admission dispositions, recorded as :not-recorded-in-inherited-manifest. Suite red by an intentional assertion (the gate must stay red while blockers remain). Regressions green (151/2951 across the three separately-runnable sets). Lane availability on this seat: ANTLR fetch UnresolvedAddressException, no bb on the remote, Java 17 vs 21 for shadow, no flutter — recorded as unavailable, not green.\norchestrator-logs/1793192500000-glm-resume-yang-clojure-hardening.md:337:NOT LANDED — the slice-9 end-to-end gate is BLOCKED, honestly: 4/54 fixtures pass (subst x3, unparser guest closure); 2 mismatches (gensym freshness; free-vars context adaptation); 48 blocked by named dependencies (missing stdlib: butlast/last/nth/var?/with-meta/string?; the real unfold-implicit try path; +opacity-fn+ ambient-atom initializer refused under outcomes; an upstream LaTTe def-without-definition exposed). Coverage: 2/175 function-arity entries proven; admission dispositions never recorded in the manifest. The suite stays red by an intentional assertion. Committed 7dc18478 on yang-slice9 (pushed; not merged — blocked gates do not merge as passing).\norchestrator-logs/1793192500000-glm-resume-yang-clojure-hardening.md:339:WHAT THE NEXT PROGRAM IS (the blockers, in dependency order): (1) manifest admission dispositions (prerequisite for any coverage denominator); (2) missing stdlib additions (butlast/last/nth/with-meta/string?/var? admission decisions); (3) gensym freshness (explicit supply must thread); (4) free-vars context adaptation fix (upstream's (second def-env) shape); (5) unfold-implicit try path (the full typed-argument flow); (6) opacity atom -> context (the def-initializer refusal needs the architecture answer). Each is small; together they are